  "details": "so i had a dream in vr chat seeing an error and a UI having the a bot/Suspicous player detected and the suspicious player or bot that crashes or kicks players from the game will have a red outline EVERYWHERE it can be seen trough walls and yeah when it just happened that i saw in my dreams the walk player animation or run player animation turned into a zombie animation and the Ui had some things Such as Un pause the game (this applies for non suspicous players) and there is a lot of features on it like go to an another instance, REJOIN, and QUIT GAME, and the Un pause basically also when the game is paused by non suspicous players the Bot/Suspicous player is freezed in place and when someone un Pauses the game while the ui appeared the Ui will be still seen and when the suspicous player is about to get close to you YOU NEED TO PAUSE RIGHT NOW AND GOTO ANOTHER INSTANCE. By the way, there should be a Scanner for Suspicous players/Bots",
